# IBM Db2 LUW — ansi 위에 더한다(10-24 · 138차 · D-359): FETCH FIRST · OFFSET · WITH UR/CS/RS/RR · VALUES · MERGE · SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1 ·
#   CURRENT DATE/TIMESTAMP/SCHEMA · DECLARE GLOBAL TEMPORARY TABLE · ORGANIZE BY · SET SCHEMA · CALL · TRUNCATE … IMMEDIATE.
dialect = db2
extends = ansi

[start]
next += VALUES, CALL, SET SCHEMA, SET CURRENT SCHEMA, DECLARE GLOBAL TEMPORARY TABLE, COMMENT ON, RENAME TABLE, LOCK TABLE, TRUNCATE TABLE, REFRESH TABLE, RUNSTATS, REORG TABLE, EXPLAIN PLAN SELECTION FOR, SET CURRENT ISOLATION, SET CURRENT LOCK TIMEOUT, RELEASE SAVEPOINT

[statement SELECT]
clauses += FETCH FIRST, OFFSET, WITH UR, WITH CS, WITH RS, WITH RR, FOR UPDATE, FOR READ ONLY, OPTIMIZE FOR

[clause SELECT]
next += CURRENT DATE, CURRENT TIME, CURRENT TIMESTAMP, CURRENT SCHEMA, CURRENT USER, CURRENT SERVER, CURRENT TIMEZONE, VALUE, COALESCE, NULLIF, DECIMAL, DEC, INTEGER, INT, BIGINT, SMALLINT, VARCHAR, CHAR, DATE, TIME, TIMESTAMP, DAYS, DAYOFWEEK, DAYOFYEAR, DAYNAME, MONTHNAME, YEAR, MONTH, DAY, HOUR, MINUTE, SECOND, MICROSECOND, TIMESTAMPDIFF, TIMESTAMP_FORMAT, VARCHAR_FORMAT, TO_CHAR, TO_DATE, SUBSTR, SUBSTRING, LENGTH, LCASE, UCASE, LOWER, UPPER, LTRIM, RTRIM, TRIM, STRIP, LOCATE, POSSTR, REPLACE, LEFT, RIGHT, REPEAT, SPACE, CONCAT, LISTAGG, ROW_NUMBER, RANK, DENSE_RANK, OVER, PARTITION BY, ROUND, TRUNC, TRUNCATE, FLOOR, CEILING, ABS, MOD, POWER, SQRT, RAND, HEX, DIGITS, XMLQUERY, XMLCAST, SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1, NEXT VALUE FOR, PREVIOUS VALUE FOR
[clause FROM]
next += FETCH FIRST, OFFSET, WITH UR, WITH CS, WITH RS, WITH RR, FOR UPDATE, FOR READ ONLY, OPTIMIZE FOR, TABLE, LATERAL, FINAL TABLE, NEW TABLE, OLD TABLE, SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1
[clause WHERE]
next += FETCH FIRST, OFFSET, WITH UR, WITH CS, WITH RS, WITH RR, FOR UPDATE, OPTIMIZE FOR
[clause GROUP BY]
next += FETCH FIRST, OFFSET, GROUPING SETS, ROLLUP, CUBE, WITH UR
[clause HAVING]
next += FETCH FIRST, OFFSET, WITH UR
[clause ORDER BY]
next += FETCH FIRST, OFFSET, WITH UR, WITH CS, NULLS FIRST, NULLS LAST, FOR UPDATE, OPTIMIZE FOR
[clause OFFSET]
next = ROWS, ROW, FETCH FIRST
[clause FETCH FIRST]
next = ROWS ONLY, ROW ONLY, WITH UR, WITH CS, FOR UPDATE, OPTIMIZE FOR
[clause WITH UR]
next =
[clause WITH CS]
next =
[clause WITH RS]
next =
[clause WITH RR]
next =
[clause FOR UPDATE]
next = OF, WITH RS, WITH RR
[clause OPTIMIZE FOR]
next = ROWS, ROW
[clause INSERT INTO]
next += VALUES, SELECT, WITH
[clause VALUES]
next += NEXT VALUE FOR, CURRENT DATE, CURRENT TIMESTAMP, DEFAULT
[clause UPDATE]
next += SET
[clause CREATE]
next += TABLE IF NOT EXISTS, OR REPLACE VIEW, OR REPLACE PROCEDURE, OR REPLACE FUNCTION, OR REPLACE TRIGGER, OR REPLACE SEQUENCE, OR REPLACE ALIAS, ALIAS, SEQUENCE, PROCEDURE, FUNCTION, TRIGGER, SCHEMA, TABLESPACE, BUFFERPOOL, GLOBAL TEMPORARY TABLE, UNIQUE INDEX, INDEX, VARIABLE, TYPE, MODULE, NICKNAME, SERVER, WRAPPER, EVENT MONITOR, ROLE, TRUSTED CONTEXT, SECURITY LABEL, USAGE LIST
[clause ALTER]
next += TABLE, TABLESPACE, SEQUENCE, VIEW, PROCEDURE, FUNCTION, TRIGGER, BUFFERPOOL, NICKNAME, SERVER, DATABASE
[clause DROP]
next += TABLE IF EXISTS, ALIAS, SEQUENCE, PROCEDURE, FUNCTION, SPECIFIC PROCEDURE, SPECIFIC FUNCTION, TRIGGER, SCHEMA, TABLESPACE, BUFFERPOOL, INDEX, VARIABLE, TYPE, MODULE, NICKNAME, SERVER, WRAPPER, ROLE
[clause GRANT]
next += SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, EXECUTE ON, CONTROL ON, ALTER, INDEX, REFERENCES, ON TABLE, ON SCHEMA, ON SEQUENCE, TO USER, TO GROUP, TO ROLE, TO PUBLIC, WITH GRANT OPTION, DBADM ON DATABASE, CONNECT ON DATABASE
[clause CALL]
next =
objects = function, schema

# ★ T-200(10-30 · 82 §10-7 공식 문법 대조 ✅ 반영): 부모에서 물려받은 낱말 중 이 방언에 없는 것을 뺀다(`-=`).
[clause DELETE FROM]
next -= USING, RETURNING
[clause VALUES]
next -= RETURNING
[clause SET]
next -= RETURNING
[clause INSERT INTO]
next -= DEFAULT VALUES
[clause WITH]
next -= RECURSIVE
